// Facebook Ads conversion reporting.
//
// Copy to `Facebook.xcconfig` (gitignored) and fill both values in. Leave the copy absent, or
// either value blank, and the SDK comes up with no app id and reports nothing — the correct
// state for a checkout that is not pointed at a Facebook app.
//
// Neither value is a secret. Both ship inside every installed app by design; they are kept out
// of git because they are per-environment, not because they are sensitive.
//
// The Facebook **app secret** does not belong here, or anywhere else in this repo. It is a
// server-side Conversions API credential, and this app has no Conversions API.
//
// Both values live in the Meta App Dashboard at developers.facebook.com, not in Events Manager:
//
//   FACEBOOK_APP_ID       Apps -> [your app] -> Settings -> Basic -> App ID
//   FACEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN Apps -> [your app] -> Settings -> Advanced -> Security -> Client token
//
// The client token is not optional — both native SDKs refuse to initialise without one.
//
// These must match android/facebook.properties — one Facebook app, two platforms.

FACEBOOK_APP_ID=
FACEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN=
